{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1770.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"1d810d269b6e269efbd72a448c89e31f7dec976ad0f90170a2d89e7d1c9e38a9","ja":"（みなさん、すごいです……。\n急にこんなことになったのに、堂々としてて……）","zh":"（大家，好厉害……。\n明明突然变成这样，却还能那么从容……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1770.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"63cb6d834e01dca3083ff0f3f1d68f05ff33762d921b9a8075b78d4e1f6542c1","ja":"ええと……じゃあ、頑張ってくださいの\n気持ちを込めて！　ぱ、ぱーんち！","zh":"嗯……那么，请加油吧\n倾注心意！　啪、啪拳！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1770.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"290f1b3a9f66c4c8fb379e1ff7db97d839013eeb6106fd377973990f8c970f94","ja":"……！　わ、わたしも……えっと、ええーっと……\nケガしちゃだめですからね、のデコピンを……メッ！","zh":"……！我、我也……那个、呃……  \n这是“可不能受伤哦”的脑门弹……啪！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1770.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"b1bc1509ed90a0c0f6aca50d890bfe8839f77fe5d481f55b1d79b2b99246e964","ja":"「な、なんだ今のは～っ！？」\n「かわいすぎるぜ～～！」","zh":"「刚、刚才那是什么～！？」\n「太可爱啦～！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1770.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"82b13809fa79797534813b520dc0193adeb4ed96aaa09e9638fdcddc18bb6b4e","ja":"それじゃあ、わたしは……\nジャーマンスープレックスっていうのやってみたいな！","zh":"那么，我就……\n想试试德国式后腰摔！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1770.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"512233205a00ce5c1258ea3ceae74136e5e0109d62b6ef34b1fbac1f064d6b5b","ja":"「いや、自分は平気っすけど……\nそれだと伊吹さんの体がヤバいっすね」","zh":"不，我倒是没事……\n但那样伊吹小姐的身体就","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1770.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"fad68f156b5addd2e1a4a4e72ce9e87314235789792171fd4c44cbc13a05837d","ja":"えっ！　じゃあやめときまーす！","zh":"诶！　那还是算了吧——！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1770.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"45dfedf7e62bfafff75ee329686c7a284b014bc21b5a9e50620f27da38917502","ja":"だったら……かわいく、投げキッス！\n……チュッ！","zh":"那就……可爱地，送上飞吻！\n……啾！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1770.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"800fc8cd521730b9314e1791bd779d778833b6819bda7970494bdc914272d802","ja":"うおおおおおおおおッ！！","zh":"呜哦哦哦哦哦哦哦——！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1770.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"ede25a55573c676833dd0bfed4dc670eeab265607762f037ac469a5db108c8cd","ja":"お疲れ様。なんだかんだ、翼が一番盛り上げてたわね！\n会場が温まった状態でライブができて、よかったわ！","zh":"辛苦了。说到底，还是翼最会调动气氛呢！\n能在会场气氛正热烈的时候进行演出，真是太好了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1770.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"5071dfe39a8e7643fc022dda8ffccd69b71464f9417e40f49a8a1d990089c188","ja":"えへへ～♪　みなさんもリアクションが良くって、\nすっごく楽しかったで～す♪","zh":"嘿嘿～♪ 大家反应也都特别棒，真的超级开心～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1770.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"ad19d8e6cf967ce27ac2d1f1cc6060ee75a8695aaaf940ff94e61e32f3fae079","ja":"わたしも、急なことでびっくりしちゃいましたけど……\nプロレスラーのみなさんのおかげで、楽しかったです！","zh":"我也因为事情来得太突然，吓了一跳，不过……多亏了各位职业摔跤选手，真的很开心！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1770.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"43950528f9ecf0f25cbf569fb7ec3b2ecd8e8f034ef27426d9c4ed499d05c310","ja":"そうね。いつものアイドルのステージとは違う、\n独特の雰囲気も味わえてよかったかも。","zh":"是啊。能体验到与平时的偶像舞台不同的独特氛围，感觉也挺不错的。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1770.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"3cbedb547c422c972825d798c9192e1a5b411820c799c094fde3188b62148ee9","ja":"アイドルのステージじゃ、やらないパフォーマンス\nだったよね。なんだか勉強になっちゃったかも♪","zh":"那是偶像舞台上不会表演的节目，对吧。感觉好像学到了什么呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1770.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"522e61ab54c3cc5f64688cdf71234e174a87f1ad46bd6ca04e448a584093b8e3","ja":"おお～！　みんなに魅力が伝わってる……！\nじゃあ今度は、本気でプロレスに挑戦しちゃおっか！？","zh":"哦～！大家都感受到它的魅力了……！\n那下次要不要认真挑战一下职业摔角！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1770.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"e1c46fd796c901865e403336143ff1834af5689d46b4b06decc65ce2341aba95","ja":"ええ～っ！　本気のプロレスって……\nえ～と、それは……。","zh":"诶——！来真的职业摔跤……  \n呃，这个嘛……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1770.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"863b6bbe4aab993572081ab4c93ac9b1c4aa1a909067785308a64c8ee8664a83","ja":"無理です！","zh":"不行！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1770.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"4547d0a76d179761483a0ad1e4a6a1486bf0cc4bb6849847c7922693f19efa58","ja":"ええ～！？　なんでなんで～！？\n今ならいけると思ったのに～っ！","zh":"咦～！？为什么为什么～！？\n我还以为现在应该能行的～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
